# Go to Line (Ctrl+G): fuzzy text query, a line number, :line:column, the live preview, Enter jumps.
file story.txt
Once upon a time
there was a small fox
who lived by the river.
Every morning the fox
walked to the old bridge,
looked at the water,
and counted the fish.
One day the river was dry.
The fox walked further
than ever before
and found the sea.
end
run story.txt
wait Once upon
key ctrl+g
wait text, a line number
snap open
type fox
snap fuzzy
key down
snap moved
key ctrl+a
type 8
snap number
key ctrl+a
type :10:5
snap line-column
key enter
snap jumped
